# ── Course material (never public) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Slides, past papers + solutions, graded homework (incl. teammates' names),
# datasets, R/Python workspaces, nested project repos. Copyrighted by the
# institutions/professors and an academic-integrity risk if published.
# Only the README describing the folder convention is versioned.
Resources/*
!Resources/README.md

# ── Obsidian per-device state & plugin data ────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json
.obsidian/appearance.json
.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-git/obsidian_askpass.sh
.trash/

# ── Plugin caches (Smart Connections embeddings hold note snippets) ────────
.smart-env/

# ── Scratch / export artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*_extract/
*.log
*.tmp

# ── OS / Office junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
